      "message": "From com.android.okhttp, it looks like it\u0027s covering subpackages too. \n\nSo I\u0027d keep the internal but drop the internal.util if we can. Seems least prone to having to be revisited - we never want things under com.android.internal to show up in docs AIUI.\n\nWe may even be able to replace the lot with \"com.android\" at this point but I\u0027ll leave that up to you - it may affect other things.",
