      "writtenOn": "2018-03-06T12:16:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might look like that, but it does not cover subpackages.\n\nFrom looking at the doclava source, this is implemented by checking contains(packageName) on a Set\u003cString\u003e of hiddenPackages; The documentation here also refers to this behavior:\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+/master/buildSrc/src/main/kotlin/android/support/doclava/DoclavaTask.kt#66\n\nI think it would be better for doclava to hide subpackages (through this or another option), but that\u0027s a larger task and with potential unintended side-effects. Let\u0027s discuss on http://b/74227351 whether these semantics should change.",
